OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after motorcyclist
OL,4,Adies in A245 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died and a van
OL,7,Fdriver has been arrested following a
OL,8,Fcrash on the A245 in Byfleet, police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FSurrey Police was called to the A245
OL,12,FByfleet Road at about 07:15 BST on
OL,13,FThursday, where a 30-year-old man was
OL,14,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FThe 44-year-old man driving the van was
OL,17,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,18,Fby dangerous driving, police said.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
